{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\shengqsq\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command '$p='\"'doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml'; \"'$c=Get-Content $p; $c[389..944]; $c[1182..1350]; $c[1500..1580]'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\shengqsq\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command '$p='\"'doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml'; \"'$c=Get-Content $p; $c[389..944]; $c[1182..1350]; $c[1500..1580]'","aggregated_output":"    purpose: 定义银行卡开卡能力、模型、规则、持久化契约和失败语义。\r\n    current_state: 银行数据只用于列表展示，点击后不进入开卡；CardRepository 是首页静态 mock，工程没有银行卡持久化模型。\r\n    target_state: 形成银行、卡型、可选银行卡、验证码会话、开卡结果与持久化银行卡记录的一致模型，完整卡号只在受控后台链路使用。\r\n    delta: 新增开卡领域模型、选择校验、验证码倒计时与 RDB 保存契约。\r\n    decisions_and_gaps: [decision:single-opening-session, decision:card-number-privacy]\r\n    verification_refs:\r\n      - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n    nodes:\r\n      - node_id: bank-card-opening-domain\r\n        owner: WalletMain\r\n        current_state: BankInfo 只有列表展示字段；点击银行显示暂不支持。\r\n        target_state: BankInfo 提供支持卡型与 mock 卡片，BankCardOpeningService 校验选择和验证码并生成持久化记录。\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement_and_code\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/BankInfo.ets\r\n          - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/repository/BankRepository.ets\r\n\r\n  - view_id: runtime\r\n    viewpoint_contract: app-runtime@1\r\n    applicability: applicable\r\n    evolution_impact: changed\r\n    stakeholders: [钱包用户, WalletMain 页面与数据层]\r\n    purpose: 描述从银行点击到结果页完成的导航、状态、写库、失败恢复和首页刷新闭环。\r\n    current_state: 两个银行入口只显示暂不支持，没有后续页面、会话状态或持久化。\r\n    target_state: 两入口进入同一开卡会话；卡型和卡片选择后验证六位验证码，保存结果带完整卡号进入结果页并按结果清栈返回。\r\n    delta: 建立四段用户流程和以 BankCardRepository 为权威的持久化数据流。\r\n    decisions_and_gaps: [decision:single-opening-session, decision:result-stack-policy]\r\n    verification_refs:\r\n      - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n      - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AddBankCardPage.ets\r\n      - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AllBanksPage.ets\r\n    nodes:\r\n      - node_id: bank-card-opening-flow\r\n        owner: WalletMain\r\n        current_state: 银行点击终止在 Toast。\r\n        target_state: 银行点击、卡型选择、卡片选择、验证码、RDB 保存、结果页与完成清栈按顺序闭合。\r\n        design_basis_refs: [view:logical/node:bank-card-opening-domain]\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement_and_code\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n        contracts:\r\n          state_management:\r\n            - state_id: opening-session\r\n              ordered_steps:\r\n                - AddBankCardPage 或 AllBanksPage 调用 CardTypeSheet.open(bank)，传入所选 BankInfo；关闭时丢弃未提交选择。\r\n                - CardTypeSheet 只允许选中一个受支持卡型；同意并继续后调用 NavPathContext.stack().pushPath 进入 BankCardSelectionPage，参数包含 bankCode 与 cardType。\r\n                - BankCardSelectionPage 调用 BankRepository.getCards(bankCode, cardType) 返回 1 至 2 张完整 mock 卡；页面只渲染 maskCardNumber(fullNumber)。\r\n                - 用户选卡并同意协议后，BankCardSelectionPage 打开 OtpVerificationSheet，内存参数包含所选完整 BankCardCandidate。\r\n                - OtpVerificationSheet 出现时调用 AccountService.getUserProfile() 取得 UserProfile.mobile，渲染掩码手机号；随后调用 OtpService.sendMockCode(mobile) 并启动 60 秒倒计时，仅接受六位数字，倒计时结束前禁止重发。\r\n                - OtpVerificationSheet 关闭或 aboutToDisappear 时取消 Timer 并清空 otp/sending/saving；关闭验证码弹层只丢弃验证码状态，保留具体卡片页上的当前卡片选择供用户继续。\r\n                - 用户提交验证码后，OtpVerificationSheet 调用 BankCardOpeningService.toStoredCard(candidate) 生成 StoredCard，再调用 BankCardRepository.save(card) 并等待 RDB 返回；服务将成功或异常统一映射为 OpeningResult(fullCardNumber, success, errorMessage)。\r\n                - 页面将 OpeningResult 通过 NavPathStack 参数推入 BankCardOpeningResultPage；结果页禁用返回手势和系统返回。\r\n                - 用户点击完成后，结果页调用 OpeningNavigationService.finish(stack, result)：成功先把 fullCardNumber 写入进程内 BankOpeningCompletionContext，再调用 stack.clear(false) 回根首页；失败调用 stack.popToName('AddBankCardPage', false)，保留最初 AddBankCardPage 并删除 AllBanksPage、选卡页和结果页。\r\n    runtime_data_flows:\r\n      - flow_id: persisted-bank-card-flow\r\n        data_domain_refs: [data-domain:bank-card]\r\n        external_contract_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence]\r\n        source_of_truth:\r\n          authority: view:development/node:bank-card-repository\r\n          persistence: wallet_bank_cards.rdb/cards\r\n          projections_and_caches: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow]\r\n          reconciliation: 每次保存以完整卡号为唯一业务键执行单事务查询后插入；若并发唯一冲突则回查既有记录并视为成功。\r\n        triggers:\r\n          - kind: user_otp_submit\r\n            timing: 用户输入六位数字并点击下一步\r\n            idempotency: 同一完整卡号只保留一条记录；重复提交返回同一保存结果。\r\n        initial_load:\r\n          initial_load_id: opening-card-candidates\r\n          strategy: 页面按 bankCode 与 cardType 从 BankRepository 读取本地 mock 候选；结果页通过 NavPath 参数接收 OpeningResult。\r\n          owner: WalletMain\r\n          data_scope: 当前银行、卡型和已保存银行卡\r\n          freshness: mock 候选为进程内常量；OpeningResult 只对应刚完成的本次保存调用。\r\n        state_owner:\r\n          ref: view:development/node:bank-card-repository\r\n          states: [saving, saved, save_failed]\r\n        mutations: &flowMutations\r\n          - mutation_id: save-bank-card\r\n            kind: foreground\r\n            persistence_ref: wallet_bank_cards.rdb/cards\r\n            publication_ref: publication:bank-card-saved\r\n            recovery_ref: recovery:save-result\r\n        publications: &flowPublications\r\n          - publication_id: bank-card-saved\r\n            payload: OpeningResult 中的完整卡号、成功标记和错误说明；仅在内存调用链传递，不写日志或界面明文。\r\n          - publication_id: opening-completed\r\n            payload: 成功完成时发布到 BankOpeningCompletionContext 的单次完整卡号；HomeTabPage 消费即清除上下文。\r\n        subscriptions: &flowSubscriptions\r\n          - subscription_id: home-completion-on-appear\r\n            consumer_ref: consumer:wallet-home\r\n            publication_ref: publication:opening-completed\r\n            attach: HomeTabPage.aboutToAppear 调用 BankOpeningCompletionContext.consume()。\r\n            detach: 无常驻监听。\r\n            cleanup: consume() 返回后立即清空 Context 内静态值；页面仅在当前生命周期的 lastOpenedCardNumber 状态中保留，离开页面释放。\r\n            replay_or_snapshot: Context 只保留最近一次尚未消费的成功卡号。\r\n            ordering: 结果页先 publish(fullCardNumber)，再 stack.clear(false) 使 HomeTabPage 出现并消费。\r\n        consumers: &flowConsumers\r\n          - consumer_id: opening-result-page\r\n            initial_load_ref: initial-load:opening-card-candidates\r\n            update_ref: publication:bank-card-saved\r\n          - consumer_id: wallet-home\r\n            initial_load_ref: initial-load:opening-card-candidates\r\n            update_ref: publication:opening-completed\r\n        failure_recovery:\r\n          recovery_id: save-result\r\n          handling: 写库失败仍生成失败 OpeningResult 并进入结果页；数据库不留下半写记录。若写入已提交但进程在结果页 push 前终止，下次重复添加通过完整卡号幂等回查既有记录。\r\n          retry: 本轮结果页不重试，用户点击完成回添加卡片页后可重新开始；进程终止后不恢复未完成页面会话。\r\n        decisions_and_gaps: [decision:card-number-privacy, decision:result-stack-policy]\r\n        evidence_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n        logical_contract_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence]\r\n        development_owner_ref: view:development/node:bank-card-repository\r\n        lifecycle_coverage:\r\n          cold_start: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:development/node:bank-card-repository] }\r\n          warm_resume: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow] }\r\n          page_attach: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow] }\r\n          page_detach: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow] }\r\n          account_switch: { status: not_applicable, evidence_refs: [doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md] }\r\n          process_recreation: { status: covered, evidence_refs: [view:development/node:bank-card-repository] }\r\n          background_write: { status: not_applicable, evidence_refs: [doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md] }\r\n        contracts:\r\n          state_management:\r\n            - state_id: persisted-bank-card-flow-mapping\r\n              owner_ref: view:development/node:bank-card-repository\r\n              contract_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence]\r\n              ordered_steps:\r\n                - 验证码提交后把 BankCardCandidate 转为 StoredCard，并调用 BankCardRepository.save。\r\n                - Repository 在单事务内按完整卡号查询后插入，并发唯一冲突回查既有记录。\r\n                - 保存结果映射为 OpeningResult；结果页消费后，成功参数经 CompletionContext 单次交给 HomeTabPage，失败定向返回 AddBankCardPage。\r\n              lifecycle_triggers: [user_otp_submit, result_page_finish, home_tab_appear]\r\n              mutations: *flowMutations\r\n              publications: *flowPublications\r\n              subscriptions: *flowSubscriptions\r\n              consumers: *flowConsumers\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement_and_design\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n\r\n  - view_id: development\r\n    viewpoint_contract: app-development@1\r\n    applicability: applicable\r\n    evolution_impact: changed\r\n    stakeholders: [WalletMain 开发者, Phone 壳集成者, 测试人员]\r\n    purpose: 明确模块、文件、页面、服务、数据模型、资源和测试的施工责任。\r\n    current_state: WalletMain 有银行列表页面和 mock 银行数据，Phone 注册四个既有目的页；没有开卡页面、RDB 或对应服务。\r\n    target_state: WalletMain 提供完整开卡实现与跨模块导出，Phone 仅接线新增目的页；测试覆盖规则、持久化和原路由回归。\r\n    delta: 新增 WalletMain 模型、Repository、Service、页面和资源，修改两个入口、模块导出、路由映射与 Phone 目的页映射。\r\n    decisions_and_gaps: [decision:walletmain-owns-opening, decision:custom-opening-ui]\r\n    verification_refs:\r\n      - doc/module-catalog.yaml#WalletMain\r\n      - doc/architecture.md\r\n    nodes:\r\n      - node_id: bank-card-opening-ui\r\n        owner: WalletMain presentation\r\n        module: WalletMain\r\n        kind: page\r\n        current_state: 只有 AddBankCardPage 与 AllBanksPage，银行点击提示暂不支持。\r\n        target_state: 新增卡型半模态、具体卡片页、验证码半模态和结果页，并把两个入口接到同一流程。\r\n        design_basis_refs: [view:logical/node:bank-card-opening-domain, view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow]\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement_and_component_index\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - doc/component-index.yaml#WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AddBankCardPage.ets#buildAddBankCardPage\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/3-点击任意银行拉起添卡选卡半模态.jpg\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/4-点击信用卡或储蓄卡后拉起选卡页面.jpg\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/5-选中某张卡片后拉起短信验证.jpg\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/6-短信验证完成后结果页.jpg\r\n        acceptance:\r\n          criteria:\r\n            - id: AC-1\r\n              priority: P0\r\n              description: 添加银行卡页和全部银行页点击任一银行均打开该银行的卡型选择半模态。\r\n              testable: true\r\n              verification_steps: [分别从两个入口点击同一银行, 核对银行名与 logo, 核对支持卡型与后续流程一致]\r\n              expected_result: 不再提示暂不支持；半模态展示该银行支持卡型且只能单选。\r\n              ut_layer: both\r\n              ut_focus: 两个入口调用同一 opening session 参数构造与卡型单选规则。\r\n              device_focus: 两入口真机点击与半模态视觉、关闭和继续行为。\r\n            - id: AC-2\r\n              priority: P0\r\n              description: 具体卡片页按银行和卡型展示一至两张 mock 卡，界面只显示前四后四，后台保留完整卡号。\r\n              testable: true\r\n              verification_steps: [选择不同银行与卡型, 检查卡片数量和掩码, 检查传入验证码页的模型保留完整卡号]\r\n              expected_result: 展示格式为前四加掩码加后四；业务对象仍持有完整卡号。\r\n              ut_layer: both\r\n              ut_focus: 候选筛选和 maskCardNumber 边界。\r\n              device_focus: 页面布局、单选和协议门禁。\r\n            - id: AC-3\r\n              priority: P0\r\n              description: 验证码半模态出现即触发一次 mock 发送，60 秒内不可重发，仅六位数字使下一步可用。\r\n              testable: true\r\n              verification_steps: [打开验证码弹层, 输入非法和合法字符, 推进倒计时至零并重发]\r\n              expected_result: 手机号掩码来自账号 mock；倒计时、重发和按钮状态符合要求。\r\n              ut_layer: both\r\n              ut_focus: 六位数字校验、倒计时状态机和重发门禁。\r\n              device_focus: 数字键盘、弹层视觉和按钮启停。\r\n            - id: AC-4\r\n              priority: P0\r\n              description: 提交验证码后完整卡数据写入 RDB；无论成功或失败都携带完整卡号和结果进入结果页。\r\n              testable: true\r\n              verification_steps: [分别让 Repository 保存成功和失败, 读取数据库记录, 检查 OpeningResult 的完整卡号和结果]\r\n              expected_result: 成功时数据库字段完整且卡号唯一；失败时无半写记录但结果页收到完整卡号与失败状态。\r\n              ut_layer: both\r\n              ut_focus: RDB 映射、幂等和失败结果。\r\n              device_focus: 成功/失败结果页呈现与跨页参数。\r\n            - id: AC-5\r\n              priority: P0\r\n              description: 结果页无返回入口并拦截侧滑/系统返回，只能点击完成；完成后开卡过程页从栈中移除。\r\n              testable: true\r\n              verification_steps: [在结果页尝试系统返回与侧滑, 点击完成, 连续返回检查历史页已清除]\r\n              expected_result: 返回动作不离开结果页；成功携带完整卡号回钱包首页，失败回最初添加卡片页，均不能再看到本轮过程页。\r\n              ut_layer: device\r\n              ut_focus: 导航清栈计算可用纯函数覆盖。\r\n              device_focus: 返回手势拦截、完成按钮和真实 NavPathStack。\r\n            - id: AC-6\r\n              priority: P1\r\n              description: 原有添加卡片、添加银行卡、全部银行、钱包首页导航链保持可用。\r\n              testable: true\r\n              verification_steps: [运行既有路由用例, 在真机往返添加卡片与全部银行页面]\r\n              expected_result: 既有路由名称和页面返回语义不受新增流程破坏。\r\n              ut_layer: both\r\n              ut_focus: 路由注册和旧入口回归。\r\n              device_focus: 旧页面互相跳转与返回。\r\n          boundaries:\r\n            - id: BD-1\r\n              priority: P0\r\n              description: 未选择卡型、卡片、未同意协议或验证码不是六位数字时不得继续。\r\n              scenario: 用户输入或选择不完整。\r\n              handling: 保持当前页面和输入，继续按钮置灰，不创建数据库记录。\r\n              expected_behavior: 用户补齐合法输入后才可继续。\r\n              ut_layer: both\r\n              ut_focus: 卡型、卡片、协议与六位数字验证码的组合门禁。\r\n              device_focus: 四个界面的按钮启停和中途取消行为。\r\n            - id: BD-2\r\n              priority: P0\r\n              description: 倒计时期间重复点击发送不触发新发送；归零后仅一次点击重启 60 秒。\r\n              scenario: 用户快速重复点击发送验证码。\r\n              handling: 倒计时状态为唯一门禁，忽略不可用期间点击。\r\n              expected_behavior: 同一倒计时窗口只发生一次 mock 发送。\r\n              ut_layer: both\r\n              ut_focus: 60 秒倒计时状态机、重复点击忽略与归零重启。\r\n              device_focus: 倒计时文案和重发按钮实际交互。\r\n            - id: BD-3\r\n              priority: P0\r\n              description: RDB 保存异常仍进入失败结果页且不泄漏完整卡号到日志或界面。\r\n              scenario: 数据库创建、查询或插入失败。\r\n              handling: 回滚/不提交当前写入，生成失败 OpeningResult，日志只记错误类别。\r\n              expected_behavior: 失败结果页可完成退出，数据库无损坏或半写记录。\r\n              ut_layer: both\r\n              ut_focus: RDB 初始化/写入异常映射、事务原子性与敏感数据日志检查。\r\n              device_focus: 失败结果页和完成后返回添加银行卡页。\r\n            - id: BD-4\r\n              priority: P1\r\n              description: 半模态关闭或页面返回在结果页之前只丢弃当前未提交选择，不写数据库。\r\n              scenario: 用户中途取消卡型或验证码流程。\r\n              handling: 释放当前 opening session 的临时选择与计时器。\r\n              expected_behavior: 返回原入口，重新进入时从初始状态开始。\r\n              ut_layer: both\r\n              ut_focus: Sheet 关闭与页面离开时的状态和 Timer 清理。\r\n              device_focus: 中途关闭后重新进入的初始状态。\r\n          performance:\r\n            - id: NFR-1\r\n              metric: 交互响应\r\n              threshold: \"300\"\r\n              unit: ms\r\n              description: 本地页面切换和按钮状态变化在普通真机上应即时可感，目标不超过 300ms；RDB 首次初始化除外但必须有进行中状态。\r\n        contracts:\r\n          files:\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/BankInfo.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/BankCardCandidate.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/StoredCard.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/OpeningResult.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/BankOpeningCompletionContext.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/repository/BankRepository.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/repository/BankCardRepository.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/domain/service/BankCardOpeningService.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/domain/service/OtpService.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/domain/service/OpeningNavigationService.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AddBankCardPage.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AllBanksPage.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/BankCardSelectionPage.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/BankCardOpeningResultPage.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/HomeTabPage.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/components/CardTypeSheet.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/components/OtpVerificationSheet.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/shared/constant/BankConstants.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/index.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/resources/base/profile/route_map.json\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/resources/base/element/string.json\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/resources/base/element/color.json\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/resources/base/element/float.json\r\n            - 01-Product/Phone/src/main/ets/pages/index.ets\r\n            - 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/data/model/UserProfile.ets\r\n            - 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/domain/service/AccountService.ets\r\n            - 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/index.ets\r\n            - 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/ohosTest/ets/test/bank_open_card_ut.test.ets\r\n          module_dependencies:\r\n            WalletMain: [AccountManager, CommUI, CommFunc]\r\n            Phone: [WalletMain]\r\n          data_models:\r\n            - name: BankCardCandidate\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/BankCardCandidate.ets\r\n              kind: interface\r\n              fields:\r\n                - { name: bankCode, type: string, required: true, description: 银行短码 }\r\n                - { name: bankName, type: string, required: true, description: 银行显示名 }\r\n                - { name: cardNumber, type: string, required: true, description: 完整 mock 卡号，仅后台链路使用 }\r\n                - { name: cardType, type: BankCardType, required: true, description: DEBIT 或 CREDIT }\r\n            - name: StoredCard\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/StoredCard.ets\r\n              kind: class\r\n              fields:\r\n                - { name: cardNumber, type: string, required: true, description: 完整卡号且为唯一业务键 }\r\n                - { name: category, type: string, required: true, description: 总卡类别，本轮为 BANK_CARD }\r\n                - { name: bankName, type: string, required: true, description: 银行名称 }\r\n                - { name: bankCardType, type: string, required: true, description: 储蓄卡或信用卡 }\r\n                - { name: addedAt, type: number, required: true, description: 添加时间毫秒时间戳 }\r\n                - { name: huaweiPayEnabled, type: boolean, required: true, description: 华为支付开通状态 }\r\n                - { name: unionPayQuickPassEnabled, type: boolean, required: true, description: 银联手机闪付状态 }\r\n                - { name: transactionRecords, type: string, required: true, description: 交易记录 JSON，本轮默认空数组 }\r\n            - name: OpeningResult\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/OpeningResult.ets\r\n              kind: class\r\n              fields:\r\n                - { name: fullCardNumber, type: string, required: true, description: 完整卡号，仅后台交接 }\r\n                - { name: success, type: boolean, required: true, description: 保存结果 }\r\n                - { name: errorMessage, type: string, required: false, description: 失败时的受控错误说明 }\r\n            - name: UserProfile\r\n              file: 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/data/model/UserProfile.ets\r\n              kind: class\r\n              fields:\r\n                - { name: mobile, type: string, required: true, description: 账号 mock 手机号，验证码页只显示掩码 }\r\n          components:\r\n            - class: CardTypeSheet\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/components/CardTypeSheet.ets\r\n              kind: component\r\n              responsibility: 展示银行与支持卡型，维护单选和协议确认。\r\n            - class: BankCardSelectionPage\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/BankCardSelectionPage.ets\r\n              kind: page\r\n              responsibility: 按银行与卡型展示掩码卡片并启动验证码弹层。\r\n            - class: OtpVerificationSheet\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/components/OtpVerificationSheet.ets\r\n              kind: component\r\n              responsibility: 读取账号 mock 手机号、发送 mock 验证码、倒计时和提交保存。\r\n            - class: BankCardOpeningResultPage\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/BankCardOpeningResultPage.ets\r\n              kind: page\r\n              responsibility: 展示成功或失败并独占完成出口。\r\n            - class: HomeTabPage\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/HomeTabPage.ets\r\n              kind: page\r\n              responsibility: aboutToAppear 消费 BankOpeningCompletionContext 的一次性完整卡号并保存为不展示、不记录日志的当前页面状态，作为后续详情入口参数。\r\n            - class: AddBankCardPage\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AddBankCardPage.ets\r\n              kind: page\r\n              responsibility: 保留原银行列表布局并把银行点击接到 CardTypeSheet。\r\n            - class: AllBanksPage\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/presentation/pages/AllBanksPage.ets\r\n              kind: page\r\n              responsibility: 保留原分组与索引并把银行点击接到同一 CardTypeSheet。\r\n          interfaces:\r\n            - class: BankCardRepository\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/repository/BankCardRepository.ets\r\n              methods:\r\n                - name: save\r\n                  params:\r\n                    - { name: card, type: StoredCard }\r\n                  return: Promise<StoredCard>\r\n                - name: list\r\n                  params: []\r\n                  return: Promise<StoredCard[]>\r\n            - class: BankCardOpeningService\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/domain/service/BankCardOpeningService.ets\r\n              methods:\r\n                - name: maskCardNumber\r\n                  params:\r\n                    - { name: cardNumber, type: string }\r\n                  return: string\r\n                - name: isValidOtp\r\n                  params:\r\n                    - { name: otp, type: string }\r\n                  return: boolean\r\n                - name: toStoredCard\r\n                  params:\r\n                    - { name: candidate, type: BankCardCandidate }\r\n                  return: StoredCard\r\n                - name: toOpeningResult\r\n                  params:\r\n                    - { name: candidate, type: BankCardCandidate }\r\n                    - { name: success, type: boolean }\r\n                    - { name: errorMessage, type: string }\r\n                  return: OpeningResult\r\n            - class: BankRepository\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/repository/BankRepository.ets\r\n              methods:\r\n                - name: getCards\r\n                  params:\r\n                    - { name: bankCode, type: string }\r\n                    - { name: cardType, type: BankCardType }\r\n                  return: Promise<BankCardCandidate[]>\r\n            - class: OtpService\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/domain/service/OtpService.ets\r\n              methods:\r\n                - name: sendMockCode\r\n                  params:\r\n                    - { name: mobile, type: string }\r\n                  return: Promise<void>\r\n            - class: OpeningNavigationService\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/domain/service/OpeningNavigationService.ets\r\n              methods:\r\n                - name: finish\r\n                  params:\r\n                    - { name: stack, type: NavPathStack }\r\n                    - { name: result, type: OpeningResult }\r\n                  return: void\r\n            - class: AccountService\r\n              file: 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/domain/service/AccountService.ets\r\n              methods:\r\n                - name: getUserProfile\r\n                  params: []\r\n                  return: Promise<UserProfile>\r\n            - class: BankOpeningCompletionContext\r\n              file: 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/model/BankOpeningCompletionContext.ets\r\n              methods:\r\n                - name: publish\r\n                  params:\r\n                    - { name: fullCardNumber, type: string }\r\n                  return: void\r\n                - name: consume\r\n                  params: []\r\n                  return: string|undefined\r\n                - name: clear\r\n                  params: []\r\n                  return: void\r\n        use_cases:\r\n          schema_version: \"1.0\"\r\n          coordinator: BankCardOpeningService\r\n          ui_bindings:\r\n            - ui: AddBankCardPage|AllBanksPage\r\n              role: opening_entry\r\n              user_actions:\r\n                - trigger: tap_bank\r\n                  calls: [openCardTypeSheet]\r\n            - ui: BankCardSelectionPage\r\n              role: card_selection\r\n              user_actions:\r\n                - trigger: tap_next\r\n                  calls: [openOtpVerificationSheet]\r\n            - ui: BankCardOpeningResultPage\r\n              role: opening_result\r\n              user_actions:\r\n                - trigger: tap_finish\r\n                  calls: [finishOpeningFlow]\r\n          use_cases:\r\n            - id: UC-1\r\n              name: 完成银行卡开卡\r\n              coordinator: BankCardOpeningService\r\n              ui_bindings:\r\n                - ui: AddBankCardPage|AllBanksPage\r\n                  role: entry\r\n                  user_actions:\r\n                    - { trigger: tap_bank, calls: [openCardTypeSheet] }\r\n                - ui: BankCardSelectionPage\r\n                  role: progress\r\n                  user_actions:\r\n                    - { trigger: tap_next, calls: [openOtpVerificationSheet] }\r\n                - ui: OtpVerificationSheet\r\n                  role: dialog\r\n                  user_actions:\r\n                    - { trigger: submit_otp, calls: [saveSelectedCard] }\r\n                - ui: BankCardOpeningResultPage\r\n                  role: result\r\n                  user_actions:\r\n                    - { trigger: tap_finish, calls: [finishOpeningFlow] }\r\n              data_boundaries:\r\n                - name: BankCardRepository\r\n                  type: BankCardRepository\r\n                  kind: storage\r\n                  methods: [save, list]\r\n              state_model:\r\n                phases: [ENTRY, TYPE_SELECTED, CARD_SELECTED, OTP_ACTIVE, SAVING, RESULT]\r\n              branches:\r\n                - scenario: 成功保存银行卡\r\n                  id: BR-SUCCESS\r\n                  linked_acceptance: [AC-1, AC-2, AC-3, AC-4, AC-5]\r\n                  expected_phase_seq: [ENTRY, TYPE_SELECTED, CARD_SELECTED, OTP_ACTIVE, SAVING, RESULT]\r\n                  expected_port_calls: [BankRepository.getCards, OtpService.sendMockCode, BankCardRepository.save, OpeningNavigationService.finish]\r\n                - scenario: 保存银行卡失败\r\n                  id: BR-FAILURE\r\n                  linked_acceptance: [AC-4, AC-5, BD-3]\r\n                  expected_phase_seq: [ENTRY, TYPE_SELECTED, CARD_SELECTED, OTP_ACTIVE, SAVING, RESULT]\r\n                  expected_port_calls: [BankCardRepository.save, OpeningNavigationService.finish]\r\n      - node_id: bank-card-repository\r\n        owner: WalletMain data\r\n        module: WalletMain\r\n        current_state: 工程没有银行卡 RDB 数据库和表。\r\n        target_state: BankCardRepository 负责 wallet_bank_cards.rdb 的创建、升级、按完整卡号幂等保存和查询。\r\n        design_basis_refs: [view:logical/node:bank-card-opening-domain]\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n      - node_id: phone-route-wiring\r\n        owner: Phone product shell\r\n        module: Phone\r\n        current_state: Phone navDestinationMap 只注册到 AllBanksPage。\r\n        target_state: Phone 额外注册 BankCardSelectionPage 与 BankCardOpeningResultPage builder，仍只负责目的页装配。\r\n        design_basis_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow]\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: current_code\r\n          source_ref: 01-Product/Phone/src/main/ets/pages/index.ets\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: observed\r\n          extraction_method: source_read\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - 01-Product/Phone/src/main/ets/pages/index.ets\r\n      - node_id: account-mobile-mock\r\n        owner: AccountManager domain\r\n        module: AccountManager\r\n        current_state: UserProfile 只有登录状态、displayAccount 与头像，AccountService 的 mock 数据没有手机号。\r\n        target_state: UserProfile 增加 mobile 字段，AccountService 初始化与登录 mock 返回固定手机号；WalletMain 只通过 AccountManager index.ets 的 AccountService.getUserProfile 读取。\r\n        design_basis_refs: [view:logical/node:bank-card-opening-domain, view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow]\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement_and_current_code\r\n          source_ref: 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/domain/service/AccountService.ets\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: observed\r\n          extraction_method: source_read_and_design\r\n        verification_refs:\r\n          - doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          - 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/data/model/UserProfile.ets\r\n          - 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/domain/service/AccountService.ets\r\n\r\ncontracts:\r\n  - contract_id: bank-card-persistence\r\n    owner: WalletMain\r\n    needed_by: bc-openCard-2\r\n    operation:\r\n      operation_id: saveBankCard\r\n      direction: internal\r\n      version: \"1\"\r\n      semantics: 按完整卡号幂等保存银行卡并返回已保存记录。\r\n      source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/operation\r\n      verification_refs: [AC-4, BD-3]\r\n    request_dto:\r\n      dto_id: SaveBankCardRequest\r\n      source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/request_dto\r\n      verification_refs: [AC-4]\r\n      fields:\r\n        - field_id: cardNumber\r\n          type: string\r\n          semantics: 完整银行卡号\r\n          nullable: false\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/request_dto/fields/0\r\n          provenance:\r\n            source_kind: requirement\r\n            source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n            observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n            evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n            extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        - field_id: bankName\r\n          type: string\r\n          semantics: 银行名称\r\n          nullable: false\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/request_dto/fields/1\r\n          provenance:\r\n            source_kind: requirement\r\n            source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n            observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n            evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n            extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        - field_id: bankCardType\r\n          type: string\r\n          semantics: 储蓄卡或信用卡\r\n          nullable: false\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/request_dto/fields/2\r\n          provenance:\r\n            source_kind: requirement\r\n            source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n            observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n            evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n            extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n    response_dto:\r\n      dto_id: OpeningResult\r\n      source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/response_dto\r\n      verification_refs: [AC-4]\r\n      fields:\r\n        - field_id: fullCardNumber\r\n          type: string\r\n          semantics: 完整银行卡号，仅后台交接\r\n          nullable: false\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/response_dto/fields/0\r\n          provenance:\r\n            source_kind: requirement\r\n            source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n            observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n            evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n            extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        - field_id: success\r\n          type: boolean\r\n          semantics: RDB 保存是否成功\r\n          nullable: false\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/response_dto/fields/1\r\n          provenance:\r\n            source_kind: requirement\r\n            source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n            observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n            evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n            extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        - field_id: errorMessage\r\n          type: string\r\n          semantics: 失败时的受控错误说明，成功时为空字符串\r\n          nullable: false\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/response_dto/fields/2\r\n          provenance:\r\n            source_kind: design\r\n            source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n            observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n            evidence_strength: inferred\r\n            extraction_method: explicit_failure_mapping\r\n    mappings:\r\n      - mapping_id: request-to-stored-card\r\n        kind: derivation\r\n        source_fields: [cardNumber, bankName, bankCardType]\r\n        target_field: StoredCard\r\n        rule: 复制完整卡号、银行名和卡型，补充 BANK_CARD、当前时间、默认 false 状态与空交易记录。\r\n        source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/mappings/0\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        verification_refs: [AC-4]\r\n      - mapping_id: persistence-to-opening-result\r\n        kind: derivation\r\n        source_fields: [fullCardNumber, success, errorMessage]\r\n        target_field: OpeningResult\r\n        rule: 将保存结果与完整卡号传给结果页；失败时保留卡号但不产生 StoredCard。\r\n        source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/mappings/1\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: requirement\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n        verification_refs: [AC-4]\r\n    errors:\r\n      values: [DATABASE_INIT_FAILED, DATABASE_WRITE_FAILED]\r\n      semantics: 任一数据库错误转换为失败 OpeningResult，不向 UI 暴露内部异常。\r\n      source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/errors\r\n      verification_refs: [BD-3]\r\n    idempotency:\r\n      key: fullCardNumber\r\n      scope: wallet_bank_cards.rdb/cards\r\n      duplicate_result: 返回既有记录并视为成功。\r\n      source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/idempotency\r\n      verification_refs: [AC-4]\r\n    nfr:\r\n      privacy: 完整卡号不得写日志或显示在 UI。\r\n      consistency: 单次保存使用 RDB 事务或单条原子插入，失败不得半写。\r\n      source_ref: doc/features/bc-openCard-2/blueprint/component-blueprint.yaml#/contracts/0/nfr\r\n      verification_refs: [AC-4, BD-3]\r\n    table_schema:\r\n      database: wallet_bank_cards.rdb\r\n      version: 1\r\n      security: 应用沙箱本地数据库，安全级别沿应用默认沙箱；本轮无额外加密要求，完整卡号不出应用。\r\n      account_scope: 当前模拟应用只有一个本地账号数据域，不写 accountId 列；未来引入多账号前必须先升级 schema 并按账号分区。\r\n      upgrade_strategy: 版本 1 首次创建 cards；未来版本使用 onUpgrade 显式迁移，禁止删除重建含卡数据的表。\r\n      tables:\r\n        - name: cards\r\n          primary_key: card_number\r\n          unique: [card_number]\r\n          columns:\r\n            - { name: card_number, type: TEXT, nullable: false }\r\n            - { name: category, type: TEXT, nullable: false, default: BANK_CARD }\r\n            - { name: bank_name, type: TEXT, nullable: false }\r\n            - { name: bank_card_type, type: TEXT, nullable: false }\r\n            - { name: added_at, type: INTEGER, nullable: false }\r\n            - { name: huawei_pay_enabled, type: INTEGER, nullable: false, default: 0 }\r\n            - { name: unionpay_quickpass_enabled, type: INTEGER, nullable: false, default: 0 }\r\n            - { name: transaction_records, type: TEXT, nullable: false, default: \"[]\" }\r\n    provenance:\r\n      source_kind: requirement_and_design\r\n      source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md\r\n      observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n      evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n      extraction_method: main_agent_design\r\n\r\nproviders:\r\n  - provider_id: current-facts-discovery\r\n    definition: 当前需求、代码、配置、测试和知识资产事实发现。\r\n    consumer: component-design\r\n    provider: static-current-facts-reader\r\n    requirement: required\r\n    authority_rule: Code, schema, interface, config, and tests are current-state authority.\r\n    source_rule: Every assertion carries source_ref and source revision when available.\r\n    missing_behavior: 缺失事实保持 unknown 并建立受控 gap。\r\n    replacement_behavior: 同源重读并使相关派生结果过期。\r\n    exit_behavior: 丢弃临时检索，保留 canonical provenance。\r\n    conflict_behavior: 保留全部冲突来源并交权威 owner 裁决。\r\n    writes: [canonical_blueprint_input]\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/5-选中某张卡片后拉起短信验证.jpg\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: direct_visual_read\r\n      - item_id: visual-opening-result\r\n        kind: requirement\r\n        source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/6-短信验证完成后结果页.jpg\r\n        source_sha256: sha256:f300cece15317a45c128d107ee39bb5c5ec9bce8e839face458ff58fcf47206c\r\n        provenance:\r\n          source_kind: local_image\r\n          source_ref: doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/6-短信验证完成后结果页.jpg\r\n          observed_at: \"2026-10-23T00:00:00-04:00\"\r\n          evidence_strength: authoritative\r\n          extraction_method: direct_visual_read\r\n  requirement_traceability:\r\n    - item_id: req-bank-card-opening\r\n      blueprint_refs: [view:scenarios/node:open-card-user-journey, view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow, view:development/node:bank-card-opening-ui, contract:bank-card-persistence]\r\n    - item_id: visual-card-type-sheet\r\n      blueprint_refs: [view:development/node:bank-card-opening-ui, view:scenarios/node:open-card-user-journey]\r\n    - item_id: visual-card-selection\r\n      blueprint_refs: [view:development/node:bank-card-opening-ui, view:scenarios/node:open-card-user-journey]\r\n    - item_id: visual-otp-sheet\r\n      blueprint_refs: [view:development/node:bank-card-opening-ui, view:scenarios/node:open-card-user-journey]\r\n    - item_id: visual-opening-result\r\n      blueprint_refs: [view:development/node:bank-card-opening-ui, view:scenarios/node:open-card-user-journey]\r\n\r\napp_lens:\r\n  module_boundaries:\r\n    disposition: answered_with_evidence\r\n    answer: WalletMain 拥有开卡业务、页面、Repository 与用例；Phone 只注册目的页；AccountManager 只提供账号 mock 数据。\r\n    evidence_refs: [doc/module-catalog.yaml, doc/architecture.md]\r\n  capability_seams:\r\n    disposition: answered_with_evidence\r\n    answer: 页面经 BankCardOpeningService、OtpService、BankCardRepository 和 OpeningNavigationService 分离校验、计时、持久化与清栈；跨模块只经各模块 index.ets。\r\n    evidence_refs: [doc/architecture.md, 02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/index.ets, 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/index.ets]\r\n  feature_flags:\r\n    disposition: not_applicable\r\n    answer: 本地模拟应用无灰度开关；通过保持原路由名和新增目的页接线确保兼容。\r\n    evidence_refs: [02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/resources/base/profile/route_map.json]\r\n  data_producers_consumers:\r\n    disposition: answered_with_evidence\r\n    answer: BankRepository 生产银行和候选卡 mock，AccountService 生产包含手机号的账号 mock，BankCardRepository 保存银行卡，结果页消费 OpeningResult；成功完成时 BankOpeningCompletionContext 暂存完整卡号，HomeTabPage.aboutToAppear 消费并立即清空 Context，页面状态只作为后续卡详情入口参数且不展示或记录日志。\r\n    evidence_refs: [02-Feature/WalletMain/src/main/ets/data/repository/BankRepository.ets, 04-BusinessBase/AccountManager/src/main/ets/domain/service/AccountService.ets]\r\n  lifecycle_triggers:\r\n    disposition: answered_with_evidence\r\n    answer: 银行点击启动会话；卡型半模态关闭时丢弃卡型选择，验证码半模态关闭或 aboutToDisappear 时取消 Timer 并清空验证码/sending/saving 状态但保留选卡页选择；结果页完成触发定向清栈。\r\n    evidence_refs: [doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md]\r\n  state_owners:\r\n    disposition: answered_with_evidence\r\n    answer: 卡型页和选卡页拥有未提交选择，OtpVerificationSheet 拥有倒计时和 saving 状态，BankCardRepository 只拥有持久化保存状态与记录，NavPathStack 是页面栈权威，BankOpeningCompletionContext 只保存成功后的单次完整卡号交接。\r\n    evidence_refs: [view:runtime/flow:persisted-bank-card-flow, 01-Product/Phone/src/main/ets/pages/index.ets]\r\n  initialization:\r\n    disposition: answered_with_evidence\r\n    answer: 候选数据按页面进入从本地 Repository 读取；账号 mock 在 AccountService 初始化；RDB 首次访问创建版本 1 表，未来 onUpgrade 显式迁移而不删除现有卡数据。\r\n    evidence_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence]\r\n  publication_subscription:\r\n    disposition: answered_with_evidence\r\n    answer: 保存完成同步返回 OpeningResult 给结果页；成功完成时将 fullCardNumber publish 到进程内 BankOpeningCompletionContext 后 clear 栈，HomeTabPage.aboutToAppear 单次 consume 并清空 Context；失败 popToName 返回 AddBankCardPage。\r\n    evidence_refs: [view:runtime/flow:persisted-bank-card-flow]\r\n  ui_refresh:\r\n    disposition: answered_with_evidence\r\n    answer: 选择、协议、验证码、倒计时和保存中状态由对应页面局部响应式状态刷新；保存结束推入结果页，成功完成后 HomeTabPage 只消费一次性完整卡号参数，不读取 RDB、不展示或记录卡号。\r\n    evidence_refs: [view:runtime/node:bank-card-opening-flow]\r\n  process_recovery:\r\n    disposition: answered_with_evidence\r\n    answer: 未完成开卡只在内存中，进程重建后重新开始；已提交银行卡以 RDB 为准，若提交后结果页尚未 push 就终止，用户下次重复添加时按完整卡号回查既有记录并得到成功结果。\r\n    evidence_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence, decision:single-opening-session]\r\n  runtime_flow_trigger_assessment:\r\n    persistent_or_remote_ui: { applies: true, evidence_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence] }\r\n    multiple_consumers: { applies: true, evidence_refs: [view:runtime/flow:persisted-bank-card-flow] }\r\n    background_system_external_scheduled_write: { applies: false, evidence_refs: [doc/features/原始需求/1-2-银行卡/原始需求.md] }\r\n    cold_start_resume_mount_account_switch: { applies: true, evidence_refs: [view:runtime/flow:persisted-bank-card-flow] }\r\n    user_mutation_refreshes_other_consumers: { applies: true, evidence_refs: [view:runtime/flow:persisted-bank-card-flow] }\r\n    cache_sync_freshness_consistency_process_recreation: { applies: true, evidence_refs: [contract:bank-card-persistence] }\r\n\r\nderived_results: []\r\n\r\nquality_attributes:\r\n  - qa_id: QA-privacy\r\n    category: security_privacy\r\n    requirement: 完整卡号不出现在界面、日志、资源或测试失败文本中。\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
